# =============================================================================
# Ricky Mobile Store - Full-Stack Architecture Environment Map
# =============================================================================
# This monorepo consists of three interconnected services:
#
#   1. store_backend            (NestJS API on port 8001)
#   2. store-web                (Customer Storefront Vite/React on port 5173)
#   3. store-management-system  (Admin CMS Next.js on port 3000)
#
# QUICK SETUP:
#   Copy the example.env in each service directory:
#
#   PowerShell:
#     copy store_backend\example.env store_backend\.env
#     copy store-web\example.env store-web\.env
#     copy store-management-system\example.env store-management-system\.env
#
#   Bash:
#     cp store_backend/example.env store_backend/.env
#     cp store-web/example.env store-web/.env
#     cp store-management-system/example.env store-management-system/.env
#
#   Then run all three services concurrently:
#     npm run dev:all
# =============================================================================

# --- Backend (store_backend/.env) ---
# PORT=8001
# DB_TYPE=sqlite
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-oauth-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
# JWT_SECRET=ricky_mobile_store_jwt_secret_key_change_me_in_production
# PASSWORD_PEPPER=ricky_mobile_store_password_pepper_secret_2026
# AI_PROVIDER=gemini
# AI_MODEL=gemini-1.5-flash
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# --- Storefront Web (store-web/.env) ---
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8001
# VITE_APP_TITLE="Ricky Mobile Store"
# VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-oauth-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com

# --- CMS / Admin (store-management-system/.env) ---
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8001
# NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_TITLE="Ricky Mobile Store Admin"
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-oauth-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
